RDY Sk X     [Surface Parameters]
  Sets the radius of surface Sk to X. Sk can be S0 (object), S1..SN (surface
  by number), or Si (current surface). X is the new radius value in current
  lens units.
REX|REY|ELX|ELY|ADX|ADY|ARO [OBS] [Sk|Si..j] value     [Apertures]
  Clear aperture (or, with OBS, obscuration) of surface Sk (default: the
  current surface): REX/REY rectangle and ELX/ELY ellipse X/Y semi-widths,
  ADX/ADY its decenter, ARO its rotation (degrees).  CIR OBS r is a circular
  obscuration.
DAR|BEN|REV [Sk|Si..j] | RET [Sk] Sj     [Tilts and Decenters]
  Decenter type of surface Sk (default: the current surface): DAR
  decenter-and-return, BEN decenter-and-bend (mirrors), REV reversed
  decenter, RET return to the coordinate system of surface Sj. DEL
  DDA|DAR|BEN|REV Sk|Si..j removes them.
ZINTEST   ZINTEST
Tilts and Decenters:
DAR       DAR|BEN|REV [Sk|Si..j] | RET [Sk] Sj
GSC       GSC [Sj]
XDE       XDE|YDE|ZDE|ADE|BDE|CDE|XOD|YOD|ZOD [Sk|Si..j] value
HELP: nothing on XYZZY (HELP INDX lists the documented commands; older KDP commands are in the original manual)
